Shingle Roof Replace. building 12
•	Full roof  back and front of the house  replacement - Architectural Shingles Timberline HDZ.
•	Installation of 14 square, of Architectural Shingles Timberline HDZ.
•	Removal of existing shingles (up to2 layers) and underlayment's  in order to expose and confirm the integrity of the existing roof sheathing.
•	Installation  of starter strip shingles and metal drip edge along the entire eaves/edges to protect the roof and guide water off the roof into the gutters.
•	Installation of grace ice & water six feet up from the eaves/edge and all the valleys to prevent leakage.
•	Installation of synthetic underlayment paper all the way up above the ice and water shield(to avoid  water damage);
•	Wrap the chimney with ice and water shield all around;
•	Install new aluminum step flashing and install a new lead flashing all around the chimney.
•	Installation of new flange pipe collar on any external roof pipes;
•	Installation of new ridge vent 12"filtered;
•	Installation of new ridge cap on the top ridge;
•	Replace one skylight approxi. 31 1/2 x 39 1/4. 
•	Complete clean-up and removal of all debris, including the use of a magnetic roller to pick up nails.

